---
title: "Procedures learned from verified runs, and their limits"
date: "2026-11-09"
excerpt: "Every verify run leaves a trajectory. agent-brain groups trajectories into procedures and can recall them for a later task, with a success rate and the command that worked. This post explains how the grouping works, how the score is built, and where it is too coarse to trust."
slug: "procedures-from-verified-runs"
